# Round 48 — wasm-pkg artifacts are committed. wasm-pack writes a
# default `*` gitignore here, which would hide the .js + .wasm pair
# that the round-48 PRD requires checking in (so first-clone `npm
# run dev` can smoke-test the bridge without rebuilding the engine).
# Keep the .wasm out of git diff noise though — it changes
# byte-for-byte on each rebuild even when the Rust source is
# unchanged. Developers regenerate it via
# `cocos4-rust/scripts/build-wasm.sh`.
*.wasm
